# PROJECT: SHOWROOM PRO — COMPLETE SAAS FRONTEND

Act as a senior frontend engineer, SaaS product designer, UI/UX specialist, and React architect.

Build a complete, professional, modern, responsive Showroom Management SaaS frontend. The product should look and feel like a premium commercial SaaS application, with a polished interface inspired by the usability of modern business dashboards.

IMPORTANT: Build the actual working frontend, not just a design mockup. Create all required files, implement every page, configure routing, and ensure that all interactive UI elements work.

For this first phase, focus ONLY on the frontend. Do not implement the real backend, authentication, database, payment processing, or n8n workflows yet. We will integrate Supabase in the next phase.

